<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>SoF decided to pay a visit on some old friends today - thanks to Borgir for some awesome pulling!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Hail friends, day isn't over yet but the news so far includes the slaying of Venril Sathir in Karnors!<br><br>Grats out to Odom on his:<br><br>Deepwater Greaves <br>Races: HUM BAR ERU ELF HIE DEF HEF DWF TRL OGR HFL GNM - Classes: PAL (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 26 - Wt: 7.5 - Slot: legs<br>Attributes: STR+8 DEX+8 AGI+7 HP+50 <br>Effect: Spirit Strength<br><br><br>Of course, hot on the heels of that acquisition our spies told us that Lord Dijon was present in Velks.  With great speed we amassed our Zergling hordes and paid him a visit and . . .<br><br>Got TPW'd.  Yep.  We died.  With him at literally ZERO health and no red showing we calfed up the ghost and he dinged on our raid team.<br><br>Not to be daunted, Adon wagged his epic noodle and in 10 mins we were at it again.  This time, with a bit more Spirit in our bones, we layeth the smack down.  With a grand total of TWO deaths for our team Lord Dijon took the dirt nap.  <br><br>Grats out to Chato on his:<br><br>Efreeti Ice Staff <br>Races: HUM IKS - Classes: MNK (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: Damage: 30 - Dly: 35 - Wt: 4.5 - Type: 2hb - Damage Per Second: 17.43<br>Attributes: AC+10 <br>Effect: Frostbite<br><br>And grats to Aurah on her:<br><br>Frost Covered Tome <br>Races: ALL - Classes: CLR NEC WIZ MAG ENC (MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 2 - Wt: 2 - Slot: handheld<br>Attributes: HP+50 MANA+50 SV MAGIC+5 <br><br>The evenings not over, but I'm off to the bar so expect someone else to update the rest.  ;)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         